<title>UK: UK meals and feeds little changed and quiet.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feeds little changed and quiet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds prices were little changed on Friday on a quiet market.</p>
<p>&quot;It's the same old story, no compounder demand, no business,&quot; said a broker.</p>
<p>The only business reported was on the rapemeal resale market were A.D.M. booking fetched 128 and 129 stg a tonne.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal was unchanged, but failed to find any buyers</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
